# Covers current Classic progression (Mists of Pandaria Classic, patch 5.5.x - verify
# the exact current number in-game with /dump select(4, GetBuildInfo()) before release).
# This file uses the generic "_Classic" suffix, which the client matches for ANY
# Classic-family flavor (Vanilla excluded - it has its own _Vanilla.toc). That means
# when progression moves on to the next expansion (e.g. Warlords of Draenor Classic),
# this same file keeps loading - just append the new Interface number to the
# comma-delimited list below instead of adding a new TOC file per expansion.
## Interface: 50505

## Title: UnitFramesImproved
## Notes: Extends the Blizzard unitframes for better visuals, with a minimal-ish footprint.
